{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026herR6auAM21792728236.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣，昨晚發生7級地震。央視報道至少16死、54人傷，逾300戶房屋倒塌受損，當局啟動三級應急響應。國家主席習近平作出重要指示，要求全力展開人員搜救，做好傷員救治工作，最大限度減少人員傷亡。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE 0730.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026wctus4Tsfc1792716715.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>地震一刻，民眾爭相走到街上避險。有居民稱當時樓房搖晃猛烈，感到驚恐。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE 0730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mMgui0MAQ21792716712.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>西藏居民說︰「我聽到咚咚咚咚，那個房子一下子搖得好兇，人全部起來了。房子搖晃兇得很，聽到那個房子搖得吱吱吱在響。我們第一反應肯定沒想到是地震，因為我們這邊沒有經歷過地震。它一直在動，肯定就反應過來了。」</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE 0730_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026VtIDb7aZhn1792716705.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>多棟建築物損毀，救援人員在瓦礫堆中搜救災民。昨晚10時33分，西藏那曲市巴青縣發生7級淺層地震，震源深度10公里。震央所在的瑪如鄉，距離縣城約70公里。多個單位在災區連夜救援，包括西部戰區官兵，還有巴青縣及甘肅省消防隊伍。當局又將帳篷、棉被及食水等物資，運去災情較嚴重地區。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE 0730_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026xqzTSZVJer1792716703.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>國家防減救災委、應急管理部指示相關部門全力做好搶險救援，安置居民及震情監測等工作。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.QUAKE 0730_006.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ayDsE41SRg1792716695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>新華社指震央附近屬高原，平均海拔約4,800米。《西藏日報》報道，較接近震央的崗切鄉亦有強烈震感，當地有災民受傷送院，部分房屋牆身龜裂。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:24:01.156272+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":487,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T01:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T16:18:30.673840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T07:18:10.212531+00:00","content_hash":"ddaa22c0b9dec89117718ac733dff6a5bf0d01e81c16d137e2461515f87917ec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T07:24:01.156272+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}